Bundled C library
-----------------

src/api, src/cap, src/cls, src/core, src/der, src/drbg, src/hash,
src/hqc, src/mldsa, src/mlkem, src/slh and src/include/noqtis.h are an
unmodified copy of the noqtis C library
(https://github.com/rootcoder007/noqtis), made by tools/vendor.sh in
that repository:

  Copyright 2026 Vansh Singh Ruhela (rootcoder007)
  License: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception (see LICENSE)

The library is an independent implementation of public standards
(FIPS 180-4, FIPS 202, FIPS 203, FIPS 204, FIPS 205, SP 800-90A, the
HQC specification v5.0.0); it contains no third-party code.

Test fixtures
-------------

inst/extdata/capsule and tests/testthat/fixtures were made with the
noqtis library and are under the same licence. No NIST or Wycheproof
test vector files are shipped in this package.

Licence note
------------

The licence field "Apache License (== 2.0) | file LICENSE" offers the
Apache License 2.0 or the Apache License 2.0 with the LLVM Exceptions
(the text in LICENSE). The exceptions only add permissions, so the two
alternatives together grant exactly what Apache-2.0 WITH
LLVM-exception grants.
